":c:data:`Py_tp_token` (for clarity, prefer :c:data:`Py_TP_USE_SPEC` rather "
"than ``NULL``)"
msgstr ""
":c:data:`Py_tp_token` (para claridad, prefiere :c:data:`Py_TP_USE_SPEC` en "
